This work is a derivative adaptation of
https://github.com/mengwuzhuanshou/HonorSchedulerUnlock (MIT License).
Original project targets HONOR MagicOS on MediaTek platforms as a
Magisk/KernelSU module. This adaptation targets the HONOR AMG-AN00
(Snapdragon 8 Gen 3 / SM8650, Android 16, MagicOS 10) driven by a
temporary, capability-restricted root shell instead of a Magisk module.

It reuses the original project's protocol understanding and node semantics,
while the scripts here are rewritten for a different platform and a
different privilege model. See README.md for the exact differences,
verified results, and remaining unverified risks.

